      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Murray_Harbour"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Shipbuilding, fishing, and farming have shaped Murray Harbour since early American Loyalist and Guernsey settler arrivals.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
