      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://murrayharbour.ca/community/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A local oral‑history project led by “Dutch” Thompson preserves PEI stories and is available through UPEI Library’s Island Voices initiative.",
